local quota exhaustion with 12 items, removed room access, test-controlled clock for expiry) pass 3 consecutive runs 
in Chrome and Edge; regression suites pass.
 107: Covers: FR-002, FR-005, FR-006, FR-007, FR-008, FR-009, BR-005, BR-006, BR-007, AC-003, AC-007, AC-008, AC-009, 
