 111: ## T10 — Cross-tab outbox ownership and leases
 112: Reasoning: Multi-tab exactly-once and ordering (R1-q16 B) is a separate failure surface from single-tab delivery.
 113: Task: All tabs of the same user share the outbox and show each item once; per conversation only the oldest 
