local stops after 2 s idle, remote TTL 4 s; payload carries the Supabase auth uid and display name → FR-017..020 gaps 
confirmed.
  25: - Realtime: `useMessageSubscription` exposes `connectionStatus` and backoff for the messages channel; 
`useConversationRealtime` (73 lines, channel `conversations-changes`) has no backoff/health. No polling anywhere. No 
IndexedDB/BroadcastChannel use; Web Locks only in `src/lib/messaging/desktop-notifications.ts` (Phase 4 cross-tab 
claim).
  26: - Drawer (`MessagingContext.tsx`): active conversation ID persisted in global `localStorage` (not per user); 
open flag not persisted → FR-031/BR-016 gap.
  27: - Sign-out: `useAuth().signOut` (`AuthContext.tsx:181`) called from `dashboard-header.tsx` and 
`enhanced-user-menu.tsx` — the in-app entry points for FR-013.
