372 to 348 (height 53), so the click hit the row's bottom padding, which did nothing (only the inner button selected). 
The purple row is the hover highlight. Eliminated: toast handler (ran only during the post-click feed wait, ~200 ms), 
console/mount errors, drawer state logic, dev-server compile; T16 only changed timing.
