  61:  * someone else, once its conversation is known. Only live Realtime events
  62:  * reach it — never the catch-up/refetch paths. Realtime can still deliver, as
  63:  * a live event, a message committed shortly before this page subscribed (it
  64:  * matches changes when it reads them from the WAL, which can lag behind the
  65:  * commit), so a message already covered by the first conversation list this
  66:  * page loaded is not announced either: messages that already existed are
  67:  * never announced (TRACK T31).
  68:  */
  69: export function useIncomingMessageNotifications({
